<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23089" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ĭn-exsŭpĕrābĭlis</span></b> 
			(<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inexup-</span></b> ),
		e, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>that cannot be crossed</i> or <i>passed over</i>, <i>insurmountable</i> (a
			favorite word with Livy). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Alpes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					5, 34, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ripa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					44, 35, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">serrae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					21, 30, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">manu,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vell.
					2, 32, 4</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">id. 2, 120, 2</span></i>.—<i>Comp.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inexsuperabilior saltus fuit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					36, 17, 3</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vis fati,</span>”
				<i>unconquerable</i>, <i>invincible</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					8, 7, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bonum,</span>”
				<i>unsurpassable</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sen.
					Ep. 85</span></i>
			.—<i>Plur.</i> as <i>subst.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inexsuperabilibus vim afferre,</span>”
				<i>to overcome impossibilities</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					38, 20, 8</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
